,"number":30,"title":"v3.1.0","description":"Proxy!","creator":{"login":"xiang90","id":4479947,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0Nzk5NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4479947?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90","html_url":"https://github.com/xiang90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":128,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-04-27T23:53:02Z","updated_at":"2018-04-26T22:32:40Z","due_on":"2016-12-31T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2017-01-13T21:47:52Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2016-08-31T00:21:50Z","updated_at":"2018-08-28T01:31:52Z","closed_at":"2016-09-02T02:55:17Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"etcdctl txn key and value specs are given as:\n\n```\n<KEY> ::= (%q formatted string)\n<VALUE> ::= (%q formatted string)\n```\n\nTo me, it is not clear what `(%q formatted string)` exactly mean here. Running the very example given, i.e.\n\n```\n./etcdctl txn <<<'mod(\"key1\") > \"0\"\n\nput key1 \"overwrote-key1\"\n\nput key1 \"created-key1\"\nput key2 \"some extra key\"\n\n'\nFAILURE\n\nOK\n\nOK\n```\n\nWhen I do `etcdctl get key1` afterwards I get `\"created-key1\"` as a value with quotes intact. Shouldn't the value be `created-key1` without the enclosing quotes? Also, it does not seem to honor other standard %q formatting such as `\\` space escaping.\n","closed_by":{"login":"heyitsanthony","id":16294350,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjk0MzUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16294350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony","html_url":"https://github.com/heyitsanthony","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6315/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}